  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Resolve local wall-clock time to UTC in Chronology.\n- Add TzDataExtensions.GetOffsetInfosForLocal, DateTimeExtensions.ToDateTimeOffset with TzDataLocalTimeResolution (Strict, Rfc5545), and DateTimeOffsetExtensions.ToOffset, handling DST gaps and overlaps.\n- Build AnyCPU only: remove the x86 and x64 build platforms.\n- Only the AnyCPU output ever ships, and no code is architecture-specific.",
